{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13332","headline":"巫山神女 · 刘方平","name":"巫山神女","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"神女藏难识，巫山秀莫羣。\n今宵爲大雨，昨日作孤云。\n散漫愁巴峡，徘徊恋楚君。\n先王爲立庙，春树几氛氲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘方平","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13332.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13332","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}